        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Numero Auto</strong> is a minimalist automation puzzle game where you build logic-based machines to manipulate numbers using physics-driven flows and transformations. Solve increasingly complex challenges by designing elegant numeric systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ <strong>Automate Numbers</strong> — Build logic-driven machines that transform and route numbers without your direct input.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔢 <strong>Data Flow Mechanics</strong> — Guide numbers through channels, designing precise and efficient numeric systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Increasingly Complex Puzzles</strong> — Each level presents a new logical challenge with multiple possible solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌐 <strong>Modules and Nodes</strong> — Combine simple blocks (pushers, adders, and multipliers) to create intricate automation chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦 <strong>Physics-Based Interactions</strong> — Numbers are physical objects that roll, fall, collide, and get stuck — take momentum into account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 <strong>Endless Optimization</strong> — Revisit previous levels to improve your designs for speed, space efficiency, or elegance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Intuitive Interface</strong> — Drag-and-drop block building with clear visual connections makes the game easy to learn and satisfying to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 <strong>Open-Ended Solutions</strong> — There’s no single right answer — creativity is your most powerful tool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>For Logic Lovers</strong> — Perfect for players who enjoy watching everything click into place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Numero Auto</strong> is a minimalist automation puzzle game where you build logic-based machines to manipulate numbers using physics-driven flows and transformations. Solve increasingly complex challenges by designing elegant numeric systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ <strong>Automate Numbers</strong> — Build logic-driven machines that transform and route numbers without your direct input.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔢 <strong>Data Flow Mechanics</strong> — Guide numbers through channels, designing precise and efficient numeric systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Increasingly Complex Puzzles</strong> — Each level presents a new logical challenge with multiple possible solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌐 <strong>Modules and Nodes</strong> — Combine simple blocks (pushers, adders, and multipliers) to create intricate automation chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦 <strong>Physics-Based Interactions</strong> — Numbers are physical objects that roll, fall, collide, and get stuck — take momentum into account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 <strong>Endless Optimization</strong> — Revisit previous levels to improve your designs for speed, space efficiency, or elegance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Intuitive Interface</strong> — Drag-and-drop block building with clear visual connections makes the game easy to learn and satisfying to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 <strong>Open-Ended Solutions</strong> — There’s no single right answer — creativity is your most powerful tool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>For Logic Lovers</strong> — Perfect for players who enjoy watching everything click into place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
